<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>2010-2012: Attack of the Clones</title>
<script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
<script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Comic Sans MS', sans-serif;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, #3a9c3f 0%, #1f6b23 55%, #0e4a10 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    width: 1024px;
    height: 768px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .slide {
    padding: 30px 50px 0 50px;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }
  h1.title {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin: 10px 0 30px 0;
  }
  h2.subtitle {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }
  ul.bullets {
    margin: 0 0 0 20px;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  ul.bullets li {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  u {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .logos-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 40px 0 0 0;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .logo-col {
    width: 280px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .placeholder {
    width: 165px;
    height: 145px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #333;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .company-name {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .company-sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .company-line {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 50px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .footer .rights {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #d5e8d5;
  }
  .footer .brand {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .footer .brand .highlight {
    color: #ffd54a;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="slide">
    <h1 class="title">2010-2012: ATTACK OF THE CLONES</h1>

    <h2 class="subtitle">Replicating a proven internet business model was hot!</h2>
    <ul class="bullets">
      <li>E-commerce business models were the most commonly copied.</li>
      <li>Forrester forecasted that the e-commerce market in Brazil would grow by <u>18%</u> annually.</li>
      <li>High profile VC's competed for deals and valuations were inflated.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="logos-row">
      <div class="logo-col">
        <div class="placeholder">[Logo: Dafiti]</div>
        <div class="company-name">Dafiti</div>
        <div class="company-sub">(Amazon clone)</div>
        <div class="company-line">Total investment of <u>$249 million</u></div>
        <div class="company-line">Estimated revenues of $200 million in 2013</div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-col">
        <div class="placeholder">[Logo: BrandsClub]</div>
        <div class="company-name">BrandsClub</div>
        <div class="company-sub">(Gilt clone)</div>
        <div class="company-line">Raised more than $17 million</div>
        <div class="company-line"><u>Facing crisis</u> and considered a failure by some</div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-col">
        <div class="placeholder">[Logo: Peixe Urbano]</div>
        <div class="company-name">Peixe Urbano</div>
        <div class="company-sub">(Groupon clone)</div>
        <div class="company-line">0-500 employees in under a year</div>
        <div class="company-line">Underwent a complete restructuring</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div>Join us: @WorldStartupRpt</div>
      <div class="rights">@2014 All Rights Reserved</div>
      <div class="brand">BRAZIL <span class="highlight">STARTUP</span> REPORT 🚩</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
